	| Locality              | Diamond Bar     |
	| Region                | California      |
	| Postal Code           | 91765           |
	| Street Address Line 1 | 456 Fake Street |''');

		LocalFile.KoroneikiAccountAPI._viewAccountExternalLinkViaIdAndDomain(
			accountName = "Korpro - ${staticProjectName}",
			domain = "salesforce",
			entityId = ${staticDossieraAccountKey},
			table = '''| Domain      | salesforce                  |
	| Entity Id   | ${staticDossieraAccountKey} |
	| Entity Name | account                     |''');

		LocalFile.KoroneikiAccountAPI._viewAccountExternalLinkViaIdAndDomain(
